Presence of this file opts the project into the protoblast plugin's checkHostWildcards
compile gate (production Java matching a host wildcard by hand -- a "*." or "**." literal in a
startsWith, contains or replace -- instead of through HostPattern, THE host grammar: "*." is
exactly one label, "**." one or more; two private matchers once read the same pattern with
different depths; see CheckHostWildcardsTask). HostPattern itself is exempt by the rule.
